# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# MMD Pose AI – Image to 3D Pose Retargeting Studio

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior desktop software engineer, AI computer vision engineer, 3D skeletal animation engineer, MikuMikuDance (MMD) technical specialist, and UI/UX designer.

Your task is to design and develop a fully functional Windows desktop application called:

**MMD Pose AI – Image to 3D Pose Retargeting Studio**

This must be a real, working desktop application, not a prototype, static interface, mockup, or demonstration.

The application must connect to the user's existing MikuMikuDance workflow, import actual MMD character models, understand their individual skeletal structures, analyze reference images using AI, reconstruct the detected pose in 3D, and export correctly mapped MMD-compatible pose and motion files.

The most important requirement is accuracy when transferring a pose from a reference image to a specific MMD model.

Never assume that every MMD model has the same bones, skeleton hierarchy, local axes, rest pose, or IK configuration.

